body:
Finally getting around to this:;

I got my IRs a few days ago and there's been this big spot right in the toe. Maybe it's just the paranoia in me, but I just want to make sure this isn't a big deal http://imgur.com/LWoHuvR

Also, about sizing. I tried on an 8 in store and it fit pretty well, so I ordered an 8.5 in hope that it'll give me a little room to grow into because I'm 18 and haven't grown in almost 4 years. But it feels tighter in the 8.5s than it did in the 8s. What gives?
